ntful/tofttmniq0qv/4SkqclPH0BExkZ7af5uliY/0e5250b0f1504c8aca2b933042dddeb9/web-trading-transaction_details-view_trading_rules.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_736,type_6/ignore-error,1"/><source data-testid="okd-image-source-webp-default" srcSet="//www.okx.com/cdn/assets/plugins/announcements/contentful/tofttmniq0qv/4SkqclPH0BExkZ7af5uliY/0e5250b0f1504c8aca2b933042dddeb9/web-trading-transaction_details-view_trading_rules.png?x-oss-process=image/format,webp/ignore-error,1"/><img data-testid="okd-picture-img-default" width="1600" height="664" class="index_baseImage__bDDyg" src="//www.okx.com/cdn/assets/plugins/announcements/contentful/tofttmniq0qv/4SkqclPH0BExkZ7af5uliY/0e5250b0f1504c8aca2b933042dddeb9/web-trading-transaction_details-view_trading_rules.png" alt="CT-web-trading-transaction details-view trading rules"/></picture></button></figure><p class="caption"><i>Select details to find out how the fee is calculated</i></p></li></ul></li><li><p>From <span class="okui-hyperlink-var okui-hyperlink okui-hyperlink-accent okui-hyperlink-underline okui-hyperlink-md okui-hyperlink-muted index_hyperlink__f2YQn" data-testid="okd-hyperlink"><a href="/en-us/balance/report-center/unified/order-history" rel="nofollow noopener noreferrer" target="_self" class="okui-powerLink-a11y okui-hyperlink-text index_mutedLink__UPRKk">Order center &gt; Order history</a></span></p><ul><li><p>Go to our <b>Order center</b> and select <b>Order history</b>. You will see the amount of the fee applied.</p><figure class="assetContainer"><button type="button" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="undefined CT-web-asset dropdown-Order center" data-testid="okd-image-viewer" class="okui-plain-button okui-image-viewer index_container__iJVBI"><picture class="okui-picture okui-picture-font"><source data-testid="okd-image-source-webp-media" media="(min-width: 1270px) and (max-width: 1859px)" srcSet="//www.okx.com/cdn/assets/plugins/announcements/contentful/tofttmniq0qv/23TyoTV9WtCqxKxNtXPud9/4ece8dace3a5a1cb5e